+# Original iOS touch-control art
+
+These RGBA16 textures are 16x16 or 32x32 conversions of the touch-button, pressed-button, joystick, and glyph images in the `sm64ios` reference project (Mission 57 worktree, `src/ios/ios/Main.storyboard` and its `Assets.xcassets`). The source controller comments credit VDavid003 and explicitly permit use of the touch controls in another port with authorship retained: <https://github.com/VDavid003/sm64-port-android>. This adaptation retains that credit. The image assets are included only as part of restoring that project's touch UI in this port.
